      "containerId": "YuSjQ_VlOOIfU9jBGZO9H",
      "originalText": "BOARD REPRESENTATION\n1)Create a chess board object.\n2)Represent all 64 squares.\n3)Store what is present on each square.\n4)Place objects onto squares.\n5)Remove objects from squares.\n6)Query what is present on a square.\n7)Print the board to the console in some readable form.",
