      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781421173194,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nClass: Board\n\n1) State\n-8 × 8 structure of Squares\n\n2) Responsibilities\n- Own and manage all squares.\n- Maintain board state.\n- Provide controlled access to squares.\n\n3) Operations\n- Print board.\n- Get a square at a position.\n- Check whether a square is occupied.\n- Get the piece on a square.\n- Place a piece on a square.\n- Remove a piece from a square.\n\n4) Design Decisions\n- Board owns Squares (Composition).\n- Internal storage is hidden.\n- Uses a 2D structure of Squares.\n- Creates all 64 Squares immediately.\n- Always maintains exactly 64 valid Squares.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Q2Bk91_2SKRm8H_x9QVdP",
      "originalText": "\nClass: Board\n\n1) State\n-8 × 8 structure of Squares\n\n2) Responsibilities\n- Own and manage all squares.\n- Maintain board state.\n- Provide controlled access to squares.\n\n3) Operations\n- Print board.\n- Get a square at a position.\n- Check whether a square is occupied.\n- Get the piece on a square.\n- Place a piece on a square.\n- Remove a piece from a square.\n\n4) Design Decisions\n- Board owns Squares (Composition).\n- Internal storage is hidden.\n- Uses a 2D structure of Squares.\n- Creates all 64 Squares immediately.\n- Always maintains exactly 64 valid Squares.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sq0TWCwMEJzGjO-904k4m",
