    {
      "id": "MTfpPVKJlpC6b1_lQFAUQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3039.726380702553,
      "y": -726.5039738644688,
      "width": 344.499755859375,
      "height": 825,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 620340724,
      "version": 3112,
      "versionNonce": 749791467,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781421173194,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nClass: Square\n\n1)Attributes:-\n- position\n- piece (optional)\n\n1)Immutable State:-\n- position\n\n3)Mutable State:-\n- piece\n\n4) Responsibilities\n- Represent a square on the board.\n- Store its location.\n- Store its occupying piece.\n- Manage occupancy.\n\n5) Operations\n- Return position.\n- Return occupying piece.\n- Tell whether occupied.\n- Accept a piece.\n- Remove a piece.\n\n6) Design Decisions\n- Position is required.\n- Piece is optional.\n- Position is immutable.\n- Piece is mutable.\n- No separate occupied attribute.\n- Occupancy is derived from piece.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sq0TWCwMEJzGjO-904k4m",
      "originalText": "\nClass: Square\n\n1)Attributes:-\n- position\n- piece (optional)\n\n1)Immutable State:-\n- position\n\n3)Mutable State:-\n- piece\n\n4) Responsibilities\n- Represent a square on the board.\n- Store its location.\n- Store its occupying piece.\n- Manage occupancy.\n\n5) Operations\n- Return position.\n- Return occupying piece.\n- Tell whether occupied.\n- Accept a piece.\n- Remove a piece.\n\n6) Design Decisions\n- Position is required.\n- Piece is optional.\n- Position is immutable.\n- Piece is mutable.\n- No separate occupied attribute.\n- Occupancy is derived from piece.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
