      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781422504724,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Class: Position\n\n1) Attributes:\n- private final int row\n- private final int column\n\n2) Responsibilities:\n- Represent a board location.\n- Store coordinates.\n- Guarantee coordinate validity.\n\n3) Operations:\n- Return row.\n- Return column.\n\n4) Design Decisions:\n- Attributes are private.\n- Coordinates are required at creation.\n- Immutable.\n- Value Object.\n- Two Position objects with identical\ncoordinates represent the same board\nlocation.\n- Prevent invalid coordinates\n\n5) Invariants\n- 0 <= row <= 7\n- 0 <= column <= 7\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "1DTgu1qmU8Ju2QTFRmjt4",
      "originalText": "Class: Position\n\n1) Attributes:\n- private final int row\n- private final int column\n\n2) Responsibilities:\n- Represent a board location.\n- Store coordinates.\n- Guarantee coordinate validity.\n\n3) Operations:\n- Return row.\n- Return column.\n\n4) Design Decisions:\n- Attributes are private.\n- Coordinates are required at creation.\n- Immutable.\n- Value Object.\n- Two Position objects with identical coordinates represent the same board location.\n- Prevent invalid coordinates\n\n5) Invariants\n- 0 <= row <= 7\n- 0 <= column <= 7\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
