      "updated": 1781421173194,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Class: Piece\n\nType:\n- Abstract class\n\nAttributes:\n- color\n\nResponsibilities:\n- Represent the common concept of a\nchess piece.\n- Store piece color.\n- Provide piece identity information.\n\nOperations:\n- Return color.\n- Return piece type.\n\nDesign Decisions:\n- Generic Piece objects cannot exist.\n- Only subclasses can be instantiated.\n- Color is required at creation.\n- Color is immutable.\n- Color uses a dedicated type with only:\n    WHITE\n    BLACK",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rgLO76wtfHGvLeTW4FEST",
      "originalText": "Class: Piece\n\nType:\n- Abstract class\n\nAttributes:\n- color\n\nResponsibilities:\n- Represent the common concept of a chess piece.\n- Store piece color.\n- Provide piece identity information.\n\nOperations:\n- Return color.\n- Return piece type.\n\nDesign Decisions:\n- Generic Piece objects cannot exist.\n- Only subclasses can be instantiated.\n- Color is required at creation.\n- Color is immutable.\n- Color uses a dedicated type with only:\n    WHITE\n    BLACK",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
